---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Byline from "../components/byline/byline.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Us"
  seo={{
    page_description: "Learn about the team behind AI & Investing and our mission to test AI stock pickers.",
    canonical_url: "https://aiandinvesting.com/about/",
    featured_image: null,
    featured_image_alt: null,
    author_twitter_handle: null,
    open_graph_type: "website",
    no_index: false
  }}
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-8">
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-balance md:text-5xl">About AI & Investing</h1>
      <Byline author_slug="editorial-team" date={new Date().toISOString()} />
      <div class="prose max-w-none text-[var(--text-main)] mt-8">
        <p>AI investing tools are heavily marketed, but verifiable performance is rarely shared. Our team conducts rigorous back-tests of AI stock pickers so you don't have to guess.</p>

        <h2>What is our core mission?</h2>
        <p>Our core mission is to bring radical transparency to the AI investing space. We firmly believe that all retail investors deserve to see verifiable, completely out-of-sample historical performance data clearly presented before they risk any real capital on opaque, heavily marketed black-box algorithmic trading systems.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
